* Atlas Transactions :EMACS_MECHANISM:
:PROPERTIES:
:ID:       bb9367ac-de5f-4a0a-bf7c-f3eb2c60f402
:END:

Transaction scope plus a tiny event bus for multi-step mutations
(capture, drawer writes, index updates).  Scope contract, stated
plainly: the DATABASE half is atomic (emacsql transaction when
available); the BUFFER half is the caller's responsibility (save at
finalize, as capture flows already do); EVENTS defer to commit and
drop on error.  Nested transactions join the outer one.  Nothing here
runs at load.

** Event bus
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defvar my/atlas-event-handlers (make-hash-table :test 'eq)
  "EVENT symbol -> list of handler functions.")

(defun my/atlas-subscribe (event fn)
  "Call FN with ARGS on every `my/atlas-emit' of EVENT."
  (puthash event (cons fn (gethash event my/atlas-event-handlers))
           my/atlas-event-handlers))

(defun my/atlas-unsubscribe (event fn)
  "Remove FN from EVENT's handlers."
  (puthash event (delq fn (gethash event my/atlas-event-handlers))
           my/atlas-event-handlers))

(defvar my/atlas-tx-queue nil
  "Deferred (EVENT . ARGS) list while inside `my/atlas-with-transaction'.")

(defun my/atlas-emit (event &rest args)
  "Emit EVENT with ARGS: queue inside a transaction, run now otherwise."
  (if my/atlas-tx-queue
      (push (cons event args) my/atlas-tx-queue)
    (dolist (fn (gethash event my/atlas-event-handlers))
      (ignore-errors (apply fn args)))))
#+end_src

** Transaction macro
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
(defvar my/atlas-tx-depth 0
  "Nesting depth of `my/atlas-with-transaction'.")

(defmacro my/atlas-with-transaction (&rest body)
  "Run BODY atomically for the database, deferring events to commit.
Opens an emacsql transaction when supported; without support (or
without a database) runs BODY plainly.  Inner transactions join the
outer one.  On error the database rolls back, queued events drop, and
the error propagates."
  (declare (indent 0) (debug t))
  `(let ((my/atlas-tx-outer (zerop my/atlas-tx-depth)))
     (if (not my/atlas-tx-outer)
         (progn ,@body)
       (let ((my/atlas-tx-depth (1+ my/atlas-tx-depth))
             (my/atlas-tx-queue nil)
             (my/atlas-tx-db (ignore-errors (manifolding-atlas-db)))
             (my/atlas-tx-ok nil))
         (unwind-protect
             (prog1
                 (if (and my/atlas-tx-db
                          (fboundp 'emacsql-with-transaction))
                     (emacsql-with-transaction my/atlas-tx-db ,@body)
                   (progn ,@body))
               (setq my/atlas-tx-ok t))
           (when my/atlas-tx-ok
             (dolist (ev (nreverse my/atlas-tx-queue))
               (dolist (fn (gethash (car ev) my/atlas-event-handlers))
                 (ignore-errors (apply fn (cdr ev)))))))))))
#+end_src
